---
import StudioLayout from "../../layouts/StudioLayout.astro";
---
<StudioLayout
  titre={'Book a call'}
  description={'45 minutes to find out whether it’s worth it.'}
  actif="contact">
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1>45 minutes to find out whether it&rsquo;s worth it.</h1>
    <p class="lead">A conversation with no commitment. We look at your processes and tell you frankly whether there is something worth automating at your company — and if the answer is no, we tell you that too.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn" href="mailto:contact@kigumi.app?subject=Kigumi%20pre-diagnosis">Write to contact@kigumi.app</a>
    </div>
    <div class="note"><p><strong>To connect</strong>An online booking calendar instead of the email link, and an address on a properly configured domain.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tint">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h2>What we&rsquo;ll look at together</h2>
    <ul class="measures">
      <li>Which processes cost you the most today, and how you know</li>
      <li>What has already been tried, and why it didn&rsquo;t hold</li>
      <li>What data exists, and who grants access to it</li>
      <li>Whether there is enough for a diagnosis, or not</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
</StudioLayout>
